<title>BRAZIL: TABLE-Lojas Amer. H1 net 14.8 mln reais.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Lojas Amer. H1 net 14.8 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian retailer Lojas Americanas SA on Monday released the following first-half 1997 financial results:</p>
<p>			  Jan-June 1997	   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Net		   14.762 million	   N/A</p>
<p>    Shr Net	     0.00032 real	     N/A</p>
<p>    Net Revs	    877.2 million	    N/A</p>
<p>    Gross Profit	215.6 million	    N/A</p>
<p>    Oper Profit	 11.84 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
